<title>FINLAND: HELIBOR INTEREST RATES MIXED AT FIX.</title>
<headline>HELIBOR INTEREST RATES MIXED AT FIX.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-11-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Helibor interest rates were</p>
<p>mixed at the Bank of Finland's daily fixing on Friday. The</p>
<p>three-month rate was steady at 3.08 percent.</p>
<p>				  November 29 fix November 28 fix</p>
<p> 1-mth Helibor		   3.03 pct		3.02 pct</p>
<p> 2-mth Helibor		   3.04 pct		3.05 pct</p>
<p> 3-mth Helibor		   3.08 pct		3.08 pct</p>
<p> 6-mth Helibor		   3.20 pct		3.20 pct</p>
<p> 9-mth Helibor		   3.30 pct		3.30 pct</p>
<p> 12-mth Helibor		  3.42 pct		3.41 pct</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom  +358 - 9 - 680 50 240</p>
</text>
